{
  "info": {
    "name": "POC 03 - Admin",
    "description": "Administração da POC 03: usuários, grupos (papéis) e permissões.\n\n**Acesso:** usuários exigem `users.manage`; grupos exigem `roles.manage`; a lista de permissões exige qualquer uma das duas. O Dario (`super-admin`) tem todas. Antes de usar, execute \"Login\" na coleção **POC 03 - Auth**.\n\n**Proteções:** só um super-admin dá o grupo `super-admin` ou mexe em usuários super-admin; o grupo `super-admin` não pode ser alterado nem excluído; ninguém exclui a própria conta nem tira de si o grupo `super-admin`.\n\nO fluxo cria um grupo e um usuário temporários e os exclui no final, então a coleção pode ser executada várias vezes pelo Collection Runner.\n\nVariáveis da coleção (preenchidas pelos scripts): `role_name`, `role_id`, `new_user_email`, `user_id`, `super_admin_role_id`, `reader_token`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Listar permissões",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Inclui as permissões de tarefas e de administração', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.include.members(['tasks.view', 'users.manage', 'roles.manage']);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/permissions",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "permissions"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Lista as permissões existentes. Exige `users.manage` ou `roles.manage`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar grupos",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const roles = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('Traz os grupos do seeder', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(roles.map(r => r.name)).to.include.members(['super-admin', 'editor', 'leitor']);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Guarda o id do super-admin para o exemplo de grupo protegido",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('super_admin_role_id', roles.find(r => r.name === 'super-admin').id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Lista os grupos (papéis) com suas permissões e o número de membros (`users_count`). Exige `roles.manage`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Criar grupo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('role_name', `revisor-${Date.now()}`);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    const role = pm.response.json().data;",
              "    pm.test('Grupo criado com as permissões', () => pm.expect(role.permissions).to.eql(['tasks.update', 'tasks.view']));",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('role_id', role.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Cria um grupo com permissões. O nome usa letras minúsculas, números, `-` ou `_` (ex.: `revisor`, `equipe-financeira`).\n\nO script de pré-requisição gera um nome único (`revisor-<timestamp>`) para a coleção poder rodar várias vezes.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{role_name}}\",\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"tasks.view\",\n    \"tasks.update\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultar grupo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles",
            "{{role_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Exibe um grupo."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Atualizar grupo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Grupo ganhou tasks.delete', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.permissions).to.include('tasks.delete'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles",
            "{{role_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Renomeia o grupo (`name`) e/ou define a lista **completa** de permissões dele (`permissions`). A mudança vale na hora para todos os membros.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"tasks.view\",\n    \"tasks.update\",\n    \"tasks.delete\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Criar usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('new_user_email', `usuario.${Date.now()}@example.com`);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    const user = pm.response.json().data;",
              "    pm.test('Usuário criado no grupo', () => pm.expect(user.roles).to.eql([pm.collectionVariables.get('role_name')]));",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', user.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Cria um usuário já com grupos (`roles`) e, opcionalmente, permissões diretas (`permissions`). Exige `users.manage`.\n\nO script de pré-requisição gera um e-mail único.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuário POC\",\n  \"email\": \"{{new_user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"{{role_name}}\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar usuários do grupo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Só o usuário criado está no grupo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().meta.total).to.eql(1));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users?role={{role_name}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "role",
              "value": "{{role_name}}",
              "description": "Nome do grupo"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Lista os usuários (paginado). Filtro opcional por grupo com `role`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultar usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Exibe um usuário com grupos (`roles`), permissões efetivas (`permissions`) e permissões diretas (`direct_permissions`)."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Atualizar usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Nome alterado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.name).to.eql('Usuário POC (editado)'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Atualiza nome, e-mail e/ou senha (apenas os campos enviados).",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuário POC (editado)\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Definir grupos do usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Usuário agora é leitor', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.roles).to.eql(['leitor']));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{user_id}}/roles",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}",
            "roles"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Define a lista **completa** de grupos do usuário (`[]` remove todos). Só um super-admin pode dar o grupo `super-admin`.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"roles\": [\n    \"leitor\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Definir permissões diretas do usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Permissões diretas e efetivas', () => {",
              "    const user = pm.response.json().data;",
              "    pm.expect(user.direct_permissions).to.eql(['tasks.create']);",
              "    pm.expect(user.permissions).to.eql(['tasks.create', 'tasks.view']);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{user_id}}/permissions",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}",
            "permissions"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Define a lista **completa** de permissões diretas do usuário (`[]` remove todas), somadas às dos grupos.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"tasks.create\"\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Alterar o grupo super-admin (403)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
              "pm.test('Mensagem de grupo protegido', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('The super-admin role cannot be changed or deleted.'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles/{{super_admin_role_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles",
            "{{super_admin_role_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "O grupo `super-admin` é protegido: não pode ser alterado nem excluído pela API.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"chefe\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Excluir usuário",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Exclui o usuário e revoga os tokens dele. Ninguém pode excluir a própria conta."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Excluir grupo",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "roles",
            "{{role_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Exclui o grupo; os membros perdem as permissões que vinham dele."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Login como leitora (Maria)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Leitora só pode visualizar tarefas', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.permissions).to.eql(['tasks.view']);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    const json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.test('Retorna um token Bearer', () => {",
              "        pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "        pm.expect(json.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
              "    });",
              "",
              "    // Token da leitora, usado só nas requisições de exemplo de permissão",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('reader_token', json.token);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Login de um usuário do papel `leitor`, que só tem a permissão `tasks.view`. O token é salvo na variável da coleção `reader_token`.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{reader_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar usuários como leitora (403)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/users",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "admin",
            "users"
          ]
        },
        "description": "A Maria (`leitor`) não tem `users.manage`: a administração responde 403.",
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{reader_token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "role_name",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "role_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "new_user_email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "super_admin_role_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reader_email",
      "value": "maria@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "password",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reader_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
